OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor sanctioned for multiple
OL,4,Aconduct breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor at
OL,7,FLeicestershire County Council has been
OL,8,Fsanctioned for multiple code of conduct
OL,9,Fbreaches.
OL,11,FMember conduct panel hearings, held at
OL,12,FCounty Hall on Friday, considered two
OL,13,Fcomplaints against Joseph Boam, one
OL,14,Flodged by a former senior council
OL,15,Fofficer and the other by a Conservative
OL,16,Fcouncillor.
OL,18,FBoam was publicly censured by the
OL,19,Fpanels, told to apologise to the
OL,20,Fcomplainants, and could be removed from
OL,21,Fthe council committees on which he
OL,22,Fsits.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
